      "answer": "Let $X\\sim\\operatorname{Binomial}(20,0.30)$. Then\n\n$$P(X\\ge8)=\\sum_{x=8}^{20}\\binom{20}{x}(0.30)^x(0.70)^{20-x}.$$\n\nEvaluating the sum gives\n\n$$P(X\\ge8)=0.227728\\ldots\\approx\\boxed{0.2277}.$$",
