      "answer": "Let $X\\sim\\operatorname{Binomial}(15,0.04)$.\n\na.\n\n$$P(X=1)=\\binom{15}{1}(0.04)(0.96)^{14}=0.338804\\ldots\\approx0.3388.$$\n\nb. Using the complement rule,\n\n$$P(X\\ge1)=1-P(X=0)=1-(0.96)^{15}=0.457914\\ldots\\approx0.4579.$$",
